    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO PickUpObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToLocation\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectChecked? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO DoTaskWithObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
